                        


Item  #SCP-5729

Object Class:  Keter

Special Containment Procedures:  Instances of SCP-5729-1 are to be held in a standard 10×10×5m stainless steel room, (by themselves) with 24/7 surveilance and 3 armed guards on duty at all times.

Description:  SCP-5729 is a cancerous growth located in the upper abdominal area and in 5% of cases brain working as a separate organ, which upon being  by an unknown factor it will manifest into rapid growths forming any of the following: controlable tentacle-like structures, coverage of the arms and/or legs or a violent burst. Upon activation of SCP-5729 the subject from now on named SCP-5729-1 will become highly aggresive attacking every multi-celular organism it encounters.

Scp-5729-1 does not seem to need any nutrition or hydration and can stay completely submerged in water for over 3 days before dying. Imstances of SCP-5729-1 seem to cooperate with other instances of SCP-5729-1 in order to achieve a common goal.

Addendum: 

Breach-01 

Number of injuries:34

Number of deaths:⬜⬜⬜

On the 5th of October ⬜⬜⬜⬜ 2 instances of SCP-5729-1 have escaped containment and killed an initial of 5 guards in the first 20 minutes. Causing full site lockdown.

3 hours later the 2 subjects were found and terminated succesfully.

Breach-02 

Number of injuries:⬜⬜⬜

Number of deaths:⬜⬜⬜

On the⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜ 5 different subject have breached containment.

Killing ⬜⬜⬜ in the first 2 hours and liberated SCP⬜⬜⬜,SCP-⬜⬜⬜⬜ and SCP-⬜⬜⬜⬜. Leading to destruction of facility via omega warhead detonation

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
